(https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness). It links against DeepSeek
Harness packages as peer dependencies; no DeepSeek Harness source is included.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications in this fork
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is a fork of zhang-guo-wen/dsh-web-design
(https://github.com/zhang-guo-wen/dsh-web-design), based on upstream commit
356127b ("chore: release 1.0.1").

The following changes were made in this fork (see the commit history for the
full list):

  * Drag-to-resize from eight outline handles on the selected element.
  * Undo support, and applying element edits (text, style, drag) in one
    committed step rather than one write per interaction.
  * Usable controls for the style editor.
  * A calmer, roomier layout for the element editor.
  * A test fix: resolve the temp workspace with a real path, so a symlinked
    macOS temp directory matches Node's fs.realpath behaviour.

